{"id":"4159c6e30fc2204f","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-schnorr-no-universal-test.md","title":"Schnorr 检验不存在零集通用者","display":"thm-schnorr-no-universal-test — Schnorr 检验不存在零集通用者","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-schnorr-no-universal-test","aliases":["43-thm-schnorr-no-universal-test"],"display":"thm-schnorr-no-universal-test — Schnorr 检验不存在零集通用者","depends_on":["[[43-df-schnorrtest]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.3 Lemma 10.3.1，印刷215，PDF235","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-schnorr-no-universal-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-schnorr-no-universal-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-schnorr-no-universal-test — Schnorr 检验不存在零集通用者"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b039951a7138aeff\" href=\"?note=b039951a7138aeff\" title=\"43-df-schnorrtest\">43-df-schnorrtest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.3 Lemma 10.3.1，印刷215，PDF235"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b039951a7138aeff\" href=\"?note=b039951a7138aeff\" title=\"43-df-schnorrtest\">43-df-schnorrtest</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}(U)\\land\\forall V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}(V)\\Rightarrow\\bigcap_nV_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_nU_n\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}(U)\\land\\forall V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}(V)\\Rightarrow\\bigcap_nV_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_nU_n\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个Schnorr检验的零集之外均有可计算点，而每个可计算点又被某个Schnorr检验捕捉，故通用者不可能存在。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.3 Lemma 10.3.1，印刷215，PDF235。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorrtest","status":"resolved","id":"b039951a7138aeff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrtest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrtest","status":"resolved","id":"b039951a7138aeff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$；$\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorrtest]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}(U)\\land\\forall V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}(V)\\Rightarrow\\bigcap_nV_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_nU_n\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1160,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-236","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-schnorr-no-universal-test]] — Schnorr 检验不存在零集通用者"}],"outgoing":["b039951a7138aeff"]}